   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<font size=\"2\">lets say I do:<br>a=seq(1, 9, by = 2)<span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"></span><br>This will give me: <span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:15px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\">[1] 1 3 5 7 9<br><br>If I do:<br><font size=\"2\">a=seq(1, 10, by = 2)<span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"></span><br>This will give me the same: <span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:15px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\">[1] 1 3 5 7 9</pre></span></font><br>is there a way to force it to include the 10 (i.e. return [1] 1 3 5 7 9 10)<font size=\"2\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:15px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"></span></font><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:15px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"></span></font><br>without adding it myself or doing any calculations?<br><br></pre></span></font>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
