     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"> I like using length.out to deal with those cases, but naturally you can&#39;t ask for (a) linear increments, (b) integers only, and (c) boundary condition simultaneously. <div><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div></div>"
    ],
