\"text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;font-variant:normal;font-style:normal;background-color:rgb(225,226,229);font-weight:normal;line-height:15px;border-collapse:separate;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;word-spacing:0px\"></span></font><font><span style=\"text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;font-variant:normal;font-style:normal;background-color:rgb(225,226,229);font-weight:normal;line-height:15px;border-collapse:separate;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;word-spacing:0px\"></span></font><br>\r\n\r\nwithout adding it myself or doing any calculations?<span><font color=\"#888888\"><br><br></font></span></pre></span></font></blockquote></div></div></div>"
