   "subject": "Re: [Israel RUG] making sure seq includes the end.",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "True. you&#39;ll have to use two steps. something like:<div><br></div><div>a &lt;- seq(a.min, a.max, by=a.step)</div><div>a &lt;- c(a, ifelse(max(a) &lt; a.max, a.max, NULL))</div>"
    ],
